# Casino Island rooms. Same row shapes as rpg-pvp-hq/rooms.pdl.
# The door picture sits at (tx, ty). The trigger is the floor cell under it (tx, ty+1).
# Walking that cell teleports to dest at arrive_x, arrive_y. auto=1: a pet may walk there.
# ROOM | id | name | floor_col | floor_row | over | cols | rows | tile_px | biome
# A normal room is 13 x 8 cells. Floor is Inside_A5. Buildings on the island are World_B.
